# Data (raw/interim/processed/prod은 용량·민감정보 이슈로 미커밋 — 경로는 .gitkeep으로 유지)
# data/schema, data/mock은 계약(contract)이므로 계속 추적함
data/raw/**
!data/raw/**/
!data/raw/**/.gitkeep

data/interim/**
!data/interim/**/
!data/interim/**/.gitkeep

data/processed/**
!data/processed/**/
!data/processed/**/.gitkeep

data/prod/**
!data/prod/**/
!data/prod/**/.gitkeep
